+NOTES = r"""
+Definition and certificate.  Section 1 defines identification and the equivalent
+H-witness partition.  Section 2, Observation 1 and Proposition 1 explain why a
+connected source component cannot be split among target components and how path
+diameters compose.  Theorem 2 uses exactly this endpoint-concatenation view to
+reduce unary Bin Packing to Identification with a linear-forest target.  The
+certificate here is the proof's partition of source components; the checker
