codex
The mandatory oracle run is externally blocked, not mathematically failed: the script reached OpenRouter, but every redraw returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded (total limit),” so the harness correctly refused to count any oracle attempt or issue a hardness verdict. I’ll still run both isolated G9 arms through the same script and retain their error records; the final report will clearly mark STEP 4 as unverified rather than treating API failures as model failures.
