Built the Track B generator and verified all local gates. It uses the paper’s linear-forest component-partition formulation from Theorem 2 and Claim 6. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.24325)

Key results:

- G1–G9(c) pass.
- Guessing: 0/200,000.
- Four attacks: 0/8 each.
- Reference 4SUM algorithm: 8/8, averaging 15,078.75 operations.
- Answer: 594 characters, 128 atoms.
- Compact route: 294 exact operations.

Files:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2604.24325/gen_2604_24325.py)
